{"3525840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Complex 629", "steam_appid": 3525840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/758954026c464a4184778e1e005d6e9c.poster.avif?t=1775580735\" width=616 height=297 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/758954026c464a4184778e1e005d6e9c.webm?t=1775580735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where are you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at your home complex 629 but you lack all your memories but why? The other residents you meet along your journey deeper into the complex speak of the devil constructing the halls you wander. Be aware however for a violent spectre stalks the halls and he is The Grandfather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/5966b03e29c10a94242b6434ed61f863.poster.avif?t=1775580735\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/5966b03e29c10a94242b6434ed61f863.webm?t=1775580735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make your way through the structure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig your way through the halls by moving the snow manually or with the aid of consumables. To Find what lies at the end of the Complex you must collect money to purchase materials so you may complete the construction of your magnum opus. The key to regaining the memories that have been stolen away from you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/06c4a0e107bf3b232d557bfb5cbc7081.poster.avif?t=1775580735\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/06c4a0e107bf3b232d557bfb5cbc7081.webm?t=1775580735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/06c4a0e107bf3b232d557bfb5cbc7081.mp4?t=1775580735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hoarding wealth and knowledge is okay in the end times </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect aspects of the devil to learn more about the complex and the world which lies outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In capitalism only the privileged prevail but since you can find money all over the complex you might have a chance to become rich! That would be if you didn't have to give it to the top 1% to progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/5720d6a2025aa20aa7884a08ea5e2861.poster.avif?t=1775580735\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/5720d6a2025aa20aa7884a08ea5e2861.webm?t=1775580735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world cools year by year and snow encroaches upon civilisations from mountain tops. Frost is the great equalizer now and few thrive. Some countries were better prepared for the cold which came ravenous. Most of all Iceland and that is where you are. That is where the Complex is. Surviving the frost outside is  hopeless but once you sign the contract and take residents within the complex hopes of leaving it are none. The Complex giveth so its residents may taketh but the Devil is not so kind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex 629 is full of things to experience and do</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a myriad of non-euclidean apartments and places embedded within one building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with multiple unique NPCs and learn their stories and experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect oodles of money and then spend it at an overpriced supermarket or gamble it away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lore from heart shaped fragments of the Devil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the vile monsters which lie within </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a girlfriend</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/758954026c464a4184778e1e005d6e9c.poster.avif?t=1775580735\" width=616 height=297 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525840/extras/758954026c464a4184778e1e005d6e9c.webm?t=1775580735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where are you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at your home complex 629 but you lack all your memories but why? The other residents you meet along your journey deeper into the complex speak of the devil constructing the halls you wander. Be aware however for a violent spectre stalks the halls and he is The Grandfather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut